    "Name": "Warthog",
    "Details": "The Warthog SL-A10 favors hit and run assaults, arming an Autocannon-5 alongside two RL 15s and a single RL 10 for single shot burst damage. Ten tons of armor plating make it more heavily protected than contemporary lighter LAMs, though this comes at the cost of noticeably reduced speed.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Land Air Mech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.03</color></b>",
